          "text": "S2: Theorem formulation.\n\n**Theorem (ALLOW admissibility).** For every candidate transition `t`:\n\\[\n\\mathrm{ALLOW}(t)\\iff \\bigl(\\mathrm{GBP}(t)\\land \\mathrm{BD}(t)\\land \\mathrm{OC}(t)\\bigr).\n\\]\n\nThus `GBP(t)`, `BD(t)`, and `OC(t)` are jointly **necessary** and jointly **sufficient** for `ALLOW(t)`.\n\n```lean\ntheorem allow_admissible\n    {Transition : Type}\n    (GBP BD OC ALLOW : Transition \u2192 Prop)\n    (contract : \u2200 t, ALLOW t \u2194 (GBP t \u2227 BD t \u2227 OC t))\n    (t : Transition) :\n    ALLOW t \u2194 (GBP t \u2227 BD t \u2227 OC t) :=\n  contract t\n```\n\n**Claim boundary:** This theorem applies only under the stipulated abstract evaluator contract; it neither specifies a deployed engine nor claims implementation validity."
